<script setup lang="ts">
import { ref } from 'vue'
import { useRouter } from 'vue-router'
import { ArrowRight, Lock, User } from '@element-plus/icons-vue'
import { useWorkspace } from '../store'
const ws = useWorkspace(), router = useRouter(), username = ref(''), password = ref(''), loading = ref(false), error = ref('')
async function login() { if (!username.value.trim() || !password.value) { error.value = '请填写用户名和密码'; return }; loading.value = true; error.value = ''; try { await ws.login(username.value.trim(), password.value); password.value = ''; router.replace('/read') } catch (e) { error.value = e instanceof Error ? e.message : '登录未完成，请重试' } finally { loading.value = false } }
</script>
<template><div class="login-page"><section class="login-intro"><div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>RefMind<small>RESEARCH WORKSPACE</small></span></div><div class="login-story"><div class="eyebrow">READ. QUESTION. VERIFY.</div><h1>读懂文献，<br>也读懂每一个出处。</h1><p>把论文、问题与原文证据放在一起，<br>让科研阅读回到清晰、可验证的思考。</p><div class="login-diagram"><div class="diagram-paper"><span>原始文献</span><i></i><i></i><i></i><div class="diagram-highlight"></div><i></i></div><div class="diagram-connector"></div><div class="diagram-note"><span>有据可循的回答</span><div><i></i><i></i></div><small>问题 → 证据 → 核验</small></div></div></div><p class="login-footnote">课题组内网工作空间 · 个人资料与共享文献分开管理</p></section><section class="login-form-area"><form class="login-form" @submit.prevent="login"><span class="small-label">欢迎回来</span><h2>登录工作空间</h2><p>使用管理员为你创建的账号继续研读。</p><el-alert v-if="error || ws.connectionError" :title="error || ws.connectionError" type="error" :closable="false" show-icon /><label for="login-username">用户名</label><el-input id="login-username" v-model="username" :prefix-icon="User" autocomplete="username" placeholder="输入用户名" size="large" maxlength="64" /><label for="login-password">密码</label><el-input id="login-password" v-model="password" :prefix-icon="Lock" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" show-password placeholder="输入密码" size="large" maxlength="256" /><el-button class="login-submit" type="primary" native-type="submit" :loading="loading" size="large">进入工作空间<el-icon><ArrowRight /></el-icon></el-button><div class="login-help">还没有账号或忘记密码？请联系工作空间管理员。</div></form></section></div></template>
